# P12 W4-0 (docs/design/sdk.md 11.3, 12.2, Q20): three kills in a row hide
# a game. Mode 5 (one 300 ms step: over 10 x its slice, killed at once),
# mode 3 (a loop of SDK calls: the kill flag, honoured at an SDK
# boundary), mode 2 (a loop in the game's own code: the watchdog's unwind,
# the simulator's model of the IRQ path). After the third, "sdk hide
# badgame kills=3" and the Games list no longer shows it.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-sdk-badgame-hide.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +3             # Game rule tests (below Bricks, Chess, Chute)
wait 600
sdk_bad 5
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot kill1
sdk_bad 3
key SELECT
wait 2500
shot kill2
sdk_bad 2
key SELECT
wait 2500
shot hidden          # no Game rule tests row
quit
